            <ArticleTitle>Myoclonic spasms after epidural diamorphine infusion.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>473-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case is presented in which myoclonus occurred after epidural diamorphine infusion. Reports of this phenomenon following other epidural drugs and possible mechanisms are discussed.</AbstractText>
